@ref s 515(6)(a) (src:11449-11465)
GIVEN charge IS A `s 515(6)(a) the charge`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 515(6)(a) the accused is charged with an indictable offence, other than an offence listed in section 469, of the kind described in subparagraphs (i) to (xiv)` MEANS
    `s 515(6) helper: all answers hold` (LIST `lead-in` , `s 515(6) helper: any answer holds` limbs)
    WHERE
        `lead-in` MEANS
            `s 515(6) helper: all answers hold` (LIST JUST (`s 493.01 the offence is treated as an indictable offence` (charge's `the offence charged`)) , `not listed in section 469`)
        `not listed in section 469` MEANS
            CONSIDER charge's `s 469 the offence charged is one listed in section 469`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): "other than an offence listed in section 469" (section 469 is outside this range)
            WHEN JUST listed THEN
                IF listed THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "with an indictable offence, other than an offence listed in section 469"
                ELSE JUST TRUE
        limbs MEANS LIST
            JUST (charge's `(i) the offence is alleged to have been committed while at large after being released in respect of another indictable offence pursuant to the provisions of this Part or section 679 or 680`)   -- (i)
            (`s 515(6) helper: any answer holds` (LIST JUST (`in the Code` AND (`section is` 467.11 OR `section is` 467.111 OR `section is` 467.12 OR `section is` 467.13))
                                                    , `s 515(6) helper: all answers hold` (LIST charge's `s 2 serious offence: the offence is one` , JUST (charge's `the offence is alleged to have been committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization`))))   -- (ii)
            (`s 515(6) helper: any answer holds` (LIST JUST (`in the Code` AND ((`section is at least` 83.02 AND `section is at most` 83.04) OR (`section is at least` 83.18 AND `section is at most` 83.23)))
                                                    , charge's `s 2 terrorism offence: the offence is one`))   -- (iii)
            JUST (charge's `(iv) the offence is under subsection 16(1) or (2), 17(1), 19(1), 20(1), 20.1(1), 20.3(1), 20.4(1) or 22(1) of the Foreign Interference and Security of Information Act`)   -- (iv)
            JUST (charge's `(v) the offence is under subsection 21(1) or section 23 of that Act committed in relation to an offence referred to in subparagraph (iv)`)   -- (v)
            JUST (`in the Code` AND (`section is` 95 OR `section is` 98 OR `section is` 98.1 OR `section is` 99 OR `section is` 100 OR `section is` 102 OR `section is` 103))   -- (vi)
            JUST (`in the Code` AND (   `section is` 244 OR `section is` 244.2
                                     OR (charge's `the offence is alleged to have been committed with a firearm`
                                         AND (   `section is` 239 OR `section is` 272 OR `section is` 273 OR (`section is` 279 AND `subsection is` "(1)") OR `section is` 279.1 OR `section is` 344 OR `section is` 346))))   -- (vii)
            JUST (charge's `(viii) the offence is alleged to involve, or its subject-matter is alleged to be, a firearm, a cross-bow, a prohibited weapon, a restricted weapon, a prohibited device, a firearm part, any ammunition or prohibited ammunition or an explosive substance`
                  AND charge's `(viii) the offence is alleged to have been committed while the accused was under a prohibition order within the meaning of subsection 84(1)`)   -- (viii)
            JUST (`in the Code` AND charge's `the accused is alleged to have choked, suffocated or strangled the complainant`
                  AND ((`section is at least` 266 AND `section is at most` 268) OR (`section is at least` 271 AND `section is at most` 273)))   -- (ix)
            JUST (`in the Code` AND (`section is` 279.01 OR `section is` 279.011))   -- (x)
            JUST (`in the Code` AND `section is` 333.1 AND (`subsection is` "(3)" OR `subsection is` "(4)"))   -- (xi)
            JUST (`in the Code` AND `section is` 346 AND charge's `violence was allegedly used, threatened or attempted against any person`)   -- (xii)
            JUST (charge's `violence was allegedly used` AND charge's `the offence would constitute the accused's third or subsequent indictable offence in the commission of which violence was used`)   -- (xii.1)
            JUST (`in the Code` AND `section is` 348 AND `subsection is` "(1)(d)")   -- (xiii)
            JUST (charge's `(xiv) the offence is under section 117 or 118 of the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act`)   -- (xiv)
        `in the Code` MEANS charge's `the offence is under the Criminal Code`
        `section is` n MEANS charge's `the Code provision the offence is under`'s `section` EQUALS n
        `section is at least` n MEANS charge's `the Code provision the offence is under`'s `section` AT LEAST n
        `section is at most` n MEANS charge's `the Code provision the offence is under`'s `section` AT MOST n
        `subsection is` s MEANS charge's `the Code provision the offence is under`'s `subsection` EQUALS s

