        IF `the date of the previous conviction of another offence in the commission of which violence was also used, threatened or attempted against any person with the use of a weapon` LESS THAN (Date (DATE_DAY `the date the accused was charged for that offence`) (DATE_MONTH `the date the accused was charged for that offence`) (DATE_YEAR `the date the accused was charged for that offence` MINUS 10))
            THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "previously convicted, within 10 years of the day on which they were charged for that offence"
