        IF `s 515(6)(b.2) the term is 10 years or more` `the maximum term of imprisonment of the offence charged` EQUALS JUST TRUE AND `s 515(6)(b.2) the term is 10 years or more` `the maximum term of imprisonment of the previous offence` EQUALS JUST TRUE
            THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if the maximum term of imprisonment for each of those offences is 10 years or more"

